# 4-space coding style

- Indentation: **4 spaces**, never tabs (`insertSpaces`, `tabSize` 4).
- Applies to **our** code under `lib/` (cli, logger wrapper, BSP, sdcard), `stm32f407_*` app `Core/` and `src/`, not huge vendored trees (`lvgl/`, `lib/fatfs/ff.c`, `lib/helix/`). `lib/mbzm/` is in-tree; format our edits (`mbzm_uart_io.c`, `zmodem_fatfs.c`) like the rest of `lib/`.
- New files and edits must use 4 spaces consistently.
